      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(0.\\overline{63} + 0.\\overline{37}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculations:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(0.\\overline{63}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;0.636363.........</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 63/99</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\( 0.\\overline{37}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;0.373737.........</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 37/99</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(0.\\overline{63} + 0.\\overline{37}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (63/99) + (37/99) =100/99</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 1.010101....</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The value is 1.0101.....</strong></p>\n",
