          "html": "0.0000625"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Given:</span></p>\n\n<p>We have to find the value of&nbsp;5&nbsp;&times; 0.005&nbsp;&times; 0.0005&nbsp;&times; 500</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Calculation:</span></p>\n\n<p>5&nbsp;&times; 0.005&nbsp;&times; 0.0005&nbsp;&times; 500</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 5&nbsp;&times; (5/1000)&nbsp;&times; (5/10000)&nbsp;&times; 500</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (5&nbsp;&times; 5&nbsp;&times; 5&nbsp;&times; 500)/(1000 &times; 10000)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 625/100000</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 0.00625</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&there4; Required simplified value is 0.00625</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
