      "question": "What will come in place of question mark in the following question? \\(\\left( {\\frac{{6.5 \\times 4.7 + 6.5 \\times 5.3}}{{1.3 \\times 7.9 - 1.3 \\times 6.9}}} \\right) = ?\\)",
      "questionHtml": "<p>What will come in place of question mark in the following question?</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\left( {\\frac{{6.5 \\times 4.7 + 6.5 \\times 5.3}}{{1.3 \\times 7.9 - 1.3 \\times 6.9}}} \\right) = ?\\)</span></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "3.9",
          "html": "3.9"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "39",
          "html": "39"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "34.45",
          "html": "34.45"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "50",
          "html": "50"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\left( {\\frac{{6.5 \\times 4.7 + 6.5 \\times 5.3}}{{1.3 \\times 7.9 - 1.3 \\times 6.9}}} \\right) = ?\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\Rightarrow \\frac{{6.5 \\times \\left( {4.7 + 5.3} \\right)}}{{1.3 \\times \\left( {7.9 - 6.9} \\right)}} = \\;?\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\Rightarrow 6.5 \\times \\frac{{10}}{{1.3}} = \\;?\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; ? = 50</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
