      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>3869 + 31.952 - ? = 3853.002</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; ? = 3869 + 31.952 &ndash; 3853.002</p>\n\n<p>Adding the integer part, we get :- 3869 + 31 &ndash; 3853 = 47</p>\n\n<p>Adding the decimal part, we get :- 0.952 &ndash; 0.002 = 0.95</p>\n&rArr; ? = 47 + 0.95 = 47.95",
