      "question": "Simplify the following expression. (12.3 &divide; 0.03) &divide; 2.05 + 2.05",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Simplify the following expression.</p>\n\n<p>(12.3&nbsp;&divide; 0.03)&nbsp;&divide; 2.05 + 2.05</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
