      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>x = 0.05&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;0.36 &divide;&nbsp;0.4 + 0.055 + 1.50 &divide;&nbsp;0.03&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x = 0.05&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;0.9&nbsp;+ 0.055 + 50</p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">x = 0.045&nbsp;+ 0.055 + 50</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">x = 50.1</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; \">&there4;</span> Option 2 is the correct answer.</strong></p>\n",
