    {
      "id": "696b012169d2-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "Find the value of \\(\\frac{(3.2~+~2.8)^2~-~12.8~ \\times~2.8 }{3.2~\\times~3.2~+~2.8~\\times~2.8~-~3.2~\\times~5.6 }\\)",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Find the value&nbsp;of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(3.2~+~2.8)^2~-~12.8~ \\times~2.8 }{3.2~\\times~3.2~+~2.8~\\times~2.8~-~3.2~\\times~5.6 }\\)</span></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "-1",
          "html": "-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "-2",
          "html": "-2"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>(a + b)<sup>2</sup> - 4ab = (a - b)<sup>2</sup> and a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> - 2ab = (a - b)<sup>2</sup></p>\n\n<p>The given expression is:</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(3.2~+~2.8)^2~-~12.8~ \\times~2.8 }{3.2~\\times~3.2~+~2.8~\\times~2.8~-~3.2~\\times~5.6 }\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>⇒ <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(3.2~+~2.8)^2~-~4~\\times~3.2~ \\times~2.8 }{3.2~\\times~3.2~+~2.8~\\times~2.8~-~2~\\times~3.2~\\times~2.8 }\\)</span> <span style=\"\">⇒ </span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(3.2~-~2.8)^2}{(3.2~-~2.8)^2}\\)</span><span style=\"\"> = 1</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Hence, The value of the expression <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(3.2~+~2.8)^2~-~12.8~ \\times~2.8 }{3.2~\\times~3.2~+~2.8~\\times~2.8~-~3.2~\\times~5.6 }\\)</span> is 1.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "696b012169d2-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "Find the value of k for the given expression: 1.3 &times; 2.1 + (6.5/0.5) - k &times; 11.5 = -1.52",
      "questionHtml": "Find the value of k for the given expression: 1.3&nbsp;&times; 2.1 + (6.5/0.5) - k&nbsp;&times; 11.5 = -1.52",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "-2.5",
          "html": "-2.5"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1.5",
          "html": "1.5"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "-1.5",
          "html": "-1.5"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>1.3&nbsp;&times; 2.1 + (6.5/0.5) - k&nbsp;&times; 11.5 = -1.52</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Concept used:</span></p>\n\n<p>Follow the<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;BODMAS</span>&nbsp;rule according to the table given below:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/image%20%284%29%20%281%29.png\" style=\"width: 440px; height: 247px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculations:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Solving the given expression using the BODMAS rule</p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;1.3&nbsp;&times; 2.1 + (6.5/0.5) - k&nbsp;&times; 11.5 = -1.52</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 2.73 + 13 - 11.5k + 1.52 = 0</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 11.5k = 15.73 + 1.52</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 11.5k = 17.25</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; k = 1.5</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The value of k for the given expression is 1.5</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/image%20%284%29%20%281%29.png"
      ],
